{"job_id":"F-536c0dcc90770c7a592e","family_id":"F-536c0dcc90770c7a592e","title":"국립공업고등학교 설치령","prior_queue_status":"QUEUED","language":"zh","rows":[{"id":"B1-zh-00001","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-011618-267219-ko","scope":"BODY","start":0,"end":12,"target_id":"eb87066648e6dbd987f43e39d2a1a3dc73db08cb011dea9df68cad8a8f819645","source_hash":"94f3bf0f8aea504aee0eb083f4a53dc2800d1821be2f2afd5cf498691bebd5e7","text":"设立国家工业高等学校条例"},{"id":"B1-zh-00002","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-011618-267219-ko","scope":"BODY","start":0,"end":131,"target_id":"f01d2029e08f62579216875bb672163264cfcd2c0c3674a17a0cc382506244e5","source_hash":"b44ce95fb9db3be0e8f17ecd6c9d8dafdfec229501c22db0ecbc2ca9edf2e437","text":"第一条（目的）本法令的目的是根据《初等和中等教育法》第62条第2款和《教育公务员法》第33条第2款，规定龟尾电子工程高中、釜山机械工程高中和全北机械工程高中的设立和运营以及教师任命等事宜。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00003","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-011618-267219-ko","scope":"BODY","start":131,"end":350,"target_id":"3ec02c2427c4fd70c8fb7b69e36794d7a2c6fb9629ad20588ce9b2276ecd7fb0","source_hash":"673edd1e59c6e7cfb6193d9b149a9177b1edcda1f71173f2844040e35312fd9c","text":"第二条（设立等）\n① 根据《初等和中等教育法》第62条第2款的规定，中小企业和创业部长官应受教育部长官委托，设立并运营龟尾电子工程高中、釜山机械工程高中和全北机械工程高中（以下简称“国立工业高中”），以系统地提供工业场所所需技术和技能的教育，并培养专业人才。<2013年3月23日修订；2017年7月26日修订>\n② 国家工业高级中学的地址如附表所示。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00004","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-011618-267219-ko","scope":"BODY","start":350,"end":433,"target_id":"0149d4df84bb813cea4cbc23e33c8c48878601cc8ca040a4f999e86414ba3193","source_hash":"8d195dbca4c87edf33979618648cc61f9c6c8b7a61714a360897016c03d767ee","text":"第三条（公务员标准配额）国家工业高等院校的公务员标准配额由“中小企业和创业部及其下属机构的组织结构”确定。<2017年7月26日修订>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00005","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-011618-267219-ko","scope":"BODY","start":433,"end":844,"target_id":"78338b176ec172fbc263d28a806b395cc327e475c1271e456eae257a8f1adda5","source_hash":"f06b8e7fbe09211df662654a1bdb1b355bd8dfe00acdd32cd3550f6f60596569","text":"第四条（教员聘任等）\n① 国家工业高中将任命一名校长。\n② 根据《教育公务员法》第三十三条第二款规定，国立工业高中的校长由总统根据中小企业和创业部长的建议任命。<2017年7月26日修订>\n③ 根据第2款规定委任校长的权力（不包括委任担任校长的权力）应根据《教育公职人员法》第33条第2款的规定，委托给中小企业和创业部长。<2017年7月26日修订>\n④ 根据《公共教育官员法》第三十三条第二款，国家工业高中的副校长、高级教师和教师由中小企业和创业部长任命。<2017年7月26日修订>\n⑤ 中小企业和创业部长根据《教育公务员法》第33条第2款的规定，将下列各款规定的任命权授予第4款规定的任命机构中的国家工业高中校长。<2017年7月26日修订>\n1. 聘任附属教师\n2. 晋升附属副校长\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00006","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-011618-267219-ko","scope":"BODY","start":844,"end":1055,"target_id":"f176ddfc79f03c7a60b0ef233dec126629ea23309964e82c32c1bd4b5b005fbd","source_hash":"f2b71419e3ff51cddccc79434ceae42846ff0dc6adfab1758c7e4202fe4698b7","text":"第五条（人员交流的特别规定）\n① 尽管《教育公职人员任命条例》第十三条之三第一款另有规定，但设有国立工业高中的地区的教育总监应当制定人员交流计划，将属于国立工业高中的教育公职人员纳入其中。\n② 根据第1款制定人员交流计划时，教育总监应当事先与国立工业高中校长协商，确定国立工业高中教育公职人员交流的规模、方式等。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00007","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-011618-267219-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1055,"end":1075,"target_id":"2abb190a0106c91f751eb5cef5585be10fdab1d596913a05763a4d74f80d134b","source_hash":"4f1f195e0042b4a0c5f13e5b95e3b348cfb40938888066c8bb4b186f0170f35b","text":"删除第 6 条 <2013.3.23>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00008","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-011618-267219-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1075,"end":1226,"target_id":"d3ac9315c91f00957589ce04616dc2d3b53f7badf4054c58e12e14998fc82a60","source_hash":"3deca510297e2b531442ba0caf7e152bffa18c01148c15654650307a1ffca589","text":"第七条（学费资助等）\n国家工业高中的学生免交入学费和学费。\n② 中小企业和创业部长可在预算范围内，为国立工业高中学生提供学习资料、服装及其他学习所需费用。<2017年7月26日修订，2021年1月5日更新>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00009","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-011618-267219-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1226,"end":1297,"target_id":"6bb6bc353caf26e0274328f36f556de53a44c5ec47474d8b8744f8ff1d7c4d03","source_hash":"9d49ccad8de53164846f8da74635176e6d66754680ec5d17b4e2e95022aad2af","text":"第八条（费用承担） 国家工业高等学校的运营所需费用由中小企业和创业部管辖的预算承担。<2017年7月26日修订>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00010","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-011618-267219-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1297,"end":1380,"target_id":"2e873ca4e0627b30ca1e985aa017a11ed32878d9cc37b79442b43d8931a87231","source_hash":"c09d5d7f0d47f27a2b66cc36c10340f9c4079d65bdbc1dad826aed55ddc8d08d","text":"第九条（与其他法律的关系）除本法令对设立和运营国立工业高等学校的规定外，适用教育相关法律的规定。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00011","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-011618-267219-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1380,"end":1504,"target_id":"d4b63d4ac0362879d77daa613bc38c7534f9d9e286e3d8ea015951003287d580","source_hash":"527eb77a48d29b3f55dd56dd6d055a3c7a44e0e1933f02d0bfe71e276547caf5","text":"第十条（授权）根据《初等和中等教育法》第六十二条第二款，教育部长将该法第六条规定的国家工业高中的指导和监督权授权给中小企业和创业部长。<2013年3月23日修订；2017年7月26日修订>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00012","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-011618-267219-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1504,"end":1528,"target_id":"55e2e76b36d1572a0d6628db945e743caaefa218e15edf4c9efedae68579ab38","source_hash":"da20c71e0f09b3ba710b089956f3a2d2864e759fcd80645de45c81dec85dc85d","text":"补充规定 <2012年5月23日 第23815号>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00013","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-011618-267219-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1528,"end":1557,"target_id":"38e9b84ec77eaae3be17bccc30f118a2fc9d4ae588092a31ce66a0eed8fc3415","source_hash":"7e5f07ffff6aef2f2136019cfb5263979ba5a34dacd8394c05b2d3c719360d57","text":"第一条（生效日期）本法令自公布之日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00014","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-011618-267219-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1557,"end":1644,"target_id":"3416ec6653930f8eb7d329c0267263a4fab58ee7506ccfaa4c18ab55b4b647ac","source_hash":"c7e858058af701c395a234ae62aa6160eaf1fa097edbff549588166667f2928b","text":"第二条（关于设立国立工业高中的过渡措施）在本法令生效时，根据《设立国立学校法令》设立的国立工业高中，应视为根据本法令设立。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00015","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-011618-267219-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1644,"end":1740,"target_id":"12641a0e8aff6d1e5bd5b7e8d931174baf9f7b4975ff9c4b121be57fe547bd17","source_hash":"15773002694d7ba634553b40e787f7ee971059ecef3f40358132858a6e2aec1e","text":"第三条（关于教师任命的过渡措施）在本法令生效时，根据《教育公务员法》和《教育公务员任命法令》任命的国立工业高中教师，应视为根据本法令任命。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00016","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-011618-267219-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1740,"end":1782,"target_id":"ca29ca0d1740d9701b5e43fb5394e5148913ac7fb432791e4910f7fd8e6abf5e","source_hash":"04e2b6050a1ac95a32bbc7f54ca1337022cd61c9de25be1baab28441060f9d39","text":"增编（中小企业管理局及其附属机构的组织结构）<2013年3月23日第24432号>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00017","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-011618-267219-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1782,"end":1811,"target_id":"1637a2f463ae16d0dcf956bb890314643e1dc2143b27c3a7b3167e44c911b99d","source_hash":"7e5f07ffff6aef2f2136019cfb5263979ba5a34dacd8394c05b2d3c719360d57","text":"第一条（生效日期）本法令自公布之日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00018","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-011618-267219-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1811,"end":1825,"target_id":"1c7ec365f603bc1707f2f7cc81a8bc8fa095ae4fa49008213eddee7a4abf030b","source_hash":"c27a8d90e2fad39db31a7ec7c05311572dbb07d5ec24565e9bc0e8ebd63ca618","text":"省略第2条和第3条\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00019","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-011618-267219-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1825,"end":1922,"target_id":"2568e8191e8ebd89dd4a463b6528f45bb3a2b5e11cb57e8c3a46acccfd5b104a","source_hash":"4dc217176b09c0318a74e6dedb0fc0deb43674b393773a92129bb33407793ff9","text":"第四条（修改其他法律）①《关于设立国立工业高等学校的法令》部分修改如下。\n\n  在第二条第一款和第十条中，“教育科学技术部长”应改为“教育部长”。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00020","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-011618-267219-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1922,"end":1960,"target_id":"4b8d69887b185310343460804f4514f7d5e3ab99ec351370c4cfa429aa6b3434","source_hash":"731638ffca4237ae66b8a6a9a7dd3feb6607e9a30f5a76e0728325d16c3a60a1","text":"增补（关于设立国立海事高中的条例）<条例编号24490，2013年3月23日>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00021","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-011618-267219-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1960,"end":1989,"target_id":"3c9fe8fc63bfa818eb07171ff1b3d8883a6bffc1777c9813a3b132deaefdae7c","source_hash":"7e5f07ffff6aef2f2136019cfb5263979ba5a34dacd8394c05b2d3c719360d57","text":"第一条（生效日期）本法令自公布之日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00022","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-011618-267219-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1989,"end":2003,"target_id":"466ab76c5ca41378229fccf37cebff76eb43a48f4a6fc80a1a42c85013ca270f","source_hash":"c27a8d90e2fad39db31a7ec7c05311572dbb07d5ec24565e9bc0e8ebd63ca618","text":"第 2 条和第 3 条已省略\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00023","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-011618-267219-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2003,"end":2077,"target_id":"9a4f89dcfe1c461f2bb2bc311a75e293676c19ac50013f6dc97d5eba876fb5bb","source_hash":"6ba43ed45a5c33e64c8f53cb1780ff410dd569e243d04370aec5f76e7813dc65","text":"第四条（修改其他法律）①《关于设立国立工业高等学校的法令》部分修改如下。\n\n  第六条被删除。\n\n  ② 和 ③ 省略\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00024","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-011618-267219-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2077,"end":2121,"target_id":"d2301c8cab97c4fda168e3494fa55f0edeabbe7818b8fc78a8ac8325b6153993","source_hash":"8e03f599c76ad5f802ccf58ce449d52e698c6013aac40e241c34ec8503098dff","text":"增编（中小企业和创业部及其附属机构的组织结构）<第28213号，2017年7月26日>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00025","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-011618-267219-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2121,"end":2150,"target_id":"19e539368fb8ce880e8c5ed3966e4b8e7fc90a4e7b48fc0da41c9327bdb0c7ea","source_hash":"7e5f07ffff6aef2f2136019cfb5263979ba5a34dacd8394c05b2d3c719360d57","text":"第一条（生效日期）本法令自公布之日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00026","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-011618-267219-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2150,"end":2167,"target_id":"f198eabdeebab7fc7918046b5d3531d716c8da0a9855bc2c4d85142e830342bd","source_hash":"90d7c234b09875f89ed9e65d48d7911823d8886f04f0ff283113cd913ec46436","text":"省略第2至5条\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00027","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-011618-267219-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2167,"end":2317,"target_id":"77005ee1f4ab7468716f52b8d6fb28c8f739e5f2219f7c1f699491f9add14291","source_hash":"4ebe77d58d453770a44a8ebf983ac858fbc37364648db54ecfcceb7b9b4e7516","text":"第六条（修改其他法律）① 省略\n\n  ②《关于设立国立工业高等学校的法令》部分修改如下。\n\n  在第二条第一款、第四条第二款至第四款、该条第五款除各分款以外的部分、第七条第二款和第十条中，“中小企业管理局局长”应改为“中小企业和创业部长”。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00028","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-011618-267219-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2317,"end":2376,"target_id":"a1654f90b78caebdbb88eb91cc30273ed271bd2ae0acf0cedbfe4fd19469f709","source_hash":"dd2a2680c1099b3652fe4af549bb32a89d5df30cb3de22c38da9701324664cac","text":"  第3条中的“「中小企业厅及其附属机构的组织结构」”应改为“「中小企业和创业部及其附属机构的组织结构」”。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00029","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-011618-267219-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2376,"end":2426,"target_id":"040ce213dc66ed6e06a3de7db40c9da85eef161d14df8e381f2d9062b5c7a372","source_hash":"d5d7d6b64f5486dd6e7f7137dbaa0519661b7ca40df7248af3c89d4cdf6eb377","text":"  第 8 条中的“中小企业管理局”应改为“中小企业和创业部”。\n\n  ③ 至 <22> 省略\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00030","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-011618-267219-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2426,"end":2517,"target_id":"0687d60a49b15480834b463d9ec9a8d720af134748950008bd697766862280bc","source_hash":"dc68266688401cbab71fd192fe9781d1d409e272f7c34d162295d23b505d5d23","text":"增补（关于部分修订473项法律以规范复杂法律术语的总统令）<第31380号，2021年1月5日>\n\n本法令自颁布之日起生效。<但书略>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00031","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-011618-267219-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2517,"end":2581,"target_id":"8dbe3fde597de64e691487afba0696bbe77d2a35277292f2af76dc6518cf384b","source_hash":"7547be954effecf16b3c9d7aede0c0ffdfb6bc0ca34e58b1dfd8beb86f6041ae","text":"补充规定（关于设立全北特别自治道和创建全球生活经济城市的特别法实施令）<第35089号，2024年12月24日>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00032","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-011618-267219-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2581,"end":2618,"target_id":"2d2490dd9d9e468ad6ec7c5ed4acae419c3fa0790cff8055c8fc7499f37a8502","source_hash":"3c1d11d2eaa0812299132d37b18af11f4aa5196dcbfc79fdce1a33c483954ca8","text":"第一条（生效日期）本法令自2024年12月27日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00033","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-011618-267219-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2618,"end":2635,"target_id":"93a0a4baf896164c41193b697fd005c4f4e6bb8410af50b1135758adc7f8afd9","source_hash":"90d7c234b09875f89ed9e65d48d7911823d8886f04f0ff283113cd913ec46436","text":"省略第2至5条\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00034","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-011618-267219-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2635,"end":3101,"target_id":"3ddea7793e14dc16c1fd48953d9283cd51cd6ae7cadf72fcd4f19f687e7faa2a","source_hash":"9e1f55db782eb1dfd7ac23014a9f3757b0604c807b41ae63b0fc433222dbe11a","text":"第六条（修改其他法律）① 省略\n\n  ②《关于设立国立工业高等学校的法令》部分修改如下。\n\n  在带星号的表格中，全北机械工程高中的地点一栏中的“全罗北道”应改为“全北特别自治道”。\n\n  ③ 至 <34> 省略\n\n国立工业高中的所在地（与第二条第二款有关）\n国立工业高中的所在地（与第二条第二款有关）  \n\n┏━━━━━━━━━━┯━━━━━━━━━━┓\n\n┃학교명              │소재지              ┃\n\n┠──────────┼──────────┨\n\n┃龟尾电子工程高中│庆尚北道┃\n\n┠──────────┼──────────┨\n\n┃釜山机械工程高中│釜山广域市┃\n\n┠──────────┼──────────┨\n\n┃全北机械工程高中│全北特别自治道 ┃\n\n┗━━━━━━━━━━┷━━━━━━━━━━┛\n\n■ 关于设立国家工业高等学校的法令[附表]<2024年12月24日修订>"},{"id":"A37254-zh-00001","doc":"A37254","law_id":"kr-011618-267219-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2716879","source_hash":"d6c1d2c57623d6f2f345979f71e4139160db6a0457fd8101a61bae9d685bc24e","text":"国立工业高中的所在地（与第二条第二款有关）"},{"id":"A37254-zh-00002","doc":"A37254","law_id":"kr-011618-267219-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2716880","source_hash":"10e8d679c2430fc1f013518201887c4f3389043f6c86cddcd95787f5a2fb4107","text":"学校名称"},{"id":"A37254-zh-00003","doc":"A37254","law_id":"kr-011618-267219-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2716881","source_hash":"ef4403031e6e67eb6ff612ac7f030ff5fcf2e12e2b56fe2fa253adc78b0c68bb","text":"位置"},{"id":"A37254-zh-00004","doc":"A37254","law_id":"kr-011618-267219-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2716882","source_hash":"779f8584307da092437fc33e856d70480ecc45d63e07126027fa35db027fb781","text":"Gumi电子工程高中"},{"id":"A37254-zh-00005","doc":"A37254","law_id":"kr-011618-267219-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2716883","source_hash":"1b743a5bc3671629a7e94f61837666f47e8c172e1f29242f82963dca15673f9d","text":"庆尚北道"},{"id":"A37254-zh-00006","doc":"A37254","law_id":"kr-011618-267219-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2716884","source_hash":"ae2f29843d446ee92a61af0590cb861e1936ef398795dbbc62764d6c084fbd05","text":"釜山机械工程高中"},{"id":"A37254-zh-00007","doc":"A37254","law_id":"kr-011618-267219-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2716885","source_hash":"05b0aae20232d424b73adf361d66825e7ff5dfded52b9b9650f9622ab23cdecb","text":"釜山广域市"},{"id":"A37254-zh-00008","doc":"A37254","law_id":"kr-011618-267219-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2716886","source_hash":"e334012194e92b8966ecb04fb44c21558ba9a184f4f8640aaac5c6c2e4b06fff","text":"全北机械工程高中"},{"id":"A37254-zh-00009","doc":"A37254","law_id":"kr-011618-267219